SUMMARY:Field Trip: International Friendsgiving & German Lantern Festival 
 (H’ville)
DESCRIPTION:AVL International Connections\n🏮 International Friendsgivin
 g & German Lantern Festival 🏮\nWednesday\, November 11\nFamilies\, you'
 re invited! Join WNC International Connections as we celebrate Saint Marti
 n's Day (Sankt Martin)\, the German tradition where children carry glowing
  lanterns to celebrate sharing\, generosity\, and light. This year our wal
 k falls on Veterans Day\, so we'll light a light for our heroes. 🇺🇸\
 n🎨 3:30–5:00 PM: Lantern making\, arts & crafts at Haus Heidelberg Ge
 rman Restaurant\, 630 Greenville Hwy\, Hendersonville (thank you\, Haus He
 idelberg!)\n🚶 5:15 PM: Lantern walk at Flat Rock Park\n🥧 Bring a des
 sert or snack to share. International treats are extra welcome!\n👨‍
 👩‍👧 Families and kids of all ages welcome\nPlease RSVP to 828-818-
 6234 so we know how many lanterns to make!\nEvent details here 👉 https:
 //www.facebook.com/share/1Dx3Bw4HXL/\nFeel free to share with friends and 
 neighbors. The more lanterns\, the brighter the walk! ✨
